# ProgramCreator v7

Premium one person studio site for Daive (@daivescales). Creator Product Scaling.
Lane A: creators, revenue split, nothing upfront.
Lane B: physical brands, monthly retainer.
Limited spots, first come first served. Never state a number.

## Absolute copy rule
All user facing copy lives in `src/lib/copy.ts` and must be pasted EXACTLY from the deck.
Never rewrite, polish, or invent marketing copy. If something is missing, ask.
Never use em dash, en dash, or a hyphen surrounded by spaces as a parenthetical.
Never write: "it's not just X, it's Y", three adjective lists, rhetorical question headings,
or openings like "But here's the thing", "The truth is", "Let's be honest", "Imagine".
`scripts/check-copy.ts` fails the build on any dash violation in src/.

## Contact and socials
email: "" with TODO. Never invent hello@/contact@. Empty renders "Email coming soon".
Socials (exact): youtube.com/@daivescales, instagram.com/daivescales/, x.com/daivescales, tiktok.com/@daivescales.
No Signature component. No MagneticButton. No HandCircle/HandArrow. Only HandUnderline.

## Colour (no grey token)
--pc-navy-900 #06172C | --pc-navy-800 #0A2039 | --pc-navy-750 #0D2846
--pc-surface rgba(255,255,255,0.03) | --pc-line 0.10 | --pc-line-2 0.20
--pc-white #FFFFFF | --pc-text #E6F0FB (ALL body) | --pc-soft #BDD4EC (rare meta only)
--pc-accent #4D9BFF | --pc-accent-2 #8FC0FF | --pc-accent-3 #2B7FEA | --pc-glow 0.30
Labels are --pc-accent. Body is --pc-text near white. Never dim body. No gray/slate classes.

## Type (six sizes only)
Inter Tight 400/500 + 600 wordmark only. Caveat 600 handwriting.
display clamp(2.4rem,4.4vw,3.6rem) w500 leading 1.06 tracking -0.02em
h2 clamp(1.7rem,2.8vw,2.4rem) w500 leading 1.12 tracking -0.015em
h3 1.125rem w500 | body 16.5px leading 1.7 max 56ch | small 14px | label 11px upper tracking 0.16em w500 accent
.hand: Caveat 1.35em accent-2 rotate -1.5deg. Five landing uses max. Headings never above 500 except wordmark 600.

## HandUnderline (only mark)
Wrapper: relative inline-block whitespace-nowrap (REQUIRED, prevents wrap clip).
SVG: absolute left 0 top 100% width 100% height 0.30em overflow visible.
viewBox 0 0 100 12, preserveAspectRatio none, path x=0 to x=100 exactly (no inset).
Variant1: M0,6.5 C22,3 40,9.5 58,6 C74,3 88,8.5 100,5
Variant2: M0,7 C20,10 38,3.5 56,7 C72,10 86,4 100,6.5
stroke currentColor (parent color accent), non-scaling-stroke, round caps.
strokeWidth = clamp(fontSize*0.085, 3.5, 11). Await document.fonts.ready before draw.
MaskText: overflow hidden during rise, overflow visible onAnimationComplete (+ timeout fallback).
Underlined headings: padding-bottom 0.4em. No ancestor overflow hidden.
Uses: hero asking, expect expect, FAQ apply, final points, form behind+send, nav hover.

## Motion
Banned: lenis/gsap/ScrollTrigger/locomotive, magnetic, scramble, scroll pin/scrub, parallax, custom cursor.
Entrances: MaskText, MaskLines, Reveal (+14px), StaggerList 0.06s, HandUnderline. whileInView once.
Ambient CSS only: glow-drift 24s, dot-pulse 2.6s, bar-breathe 4s, cta-pulse 6s.
Hovers 200ms: nav underline, CTA glow+lift, ghost border, list ArrowRight, process number scale, FAQ rotate plus, footer arrows, form focus rule, choice rows.
Accordion: CSS grid-template-rows 0fr to 1fr only. Never height auto.
Reduced motion: 0.15s fade, no ambient, underline already drawn.

## Layout
Container max-w-[1080px] px-6 md:px-10. Sections py-28 md:py-36.
At most two filled/bordered surfaces on landing. Radius 4px controls / 6px surfaces. Cap 8px.
Left aligned except final CTA. CTAs go to /apply never Cal.com.
Landing order: Hero, Model, Lanes, Process, Expect, AboutStrip, FAQ, FinalCTA.

